  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapid response and SMART Law Enforcement for tiger protection in Southeast Primorye,.Russian Far East</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to secure the future of Amur tigers in the Russian Fareast. The objectives and activities are as follows: (1) Continue Spatial Monitoring And Reporting Tool (SMART) patrol approach, and appropriate capacity development of the new United Administrations of Lazovsky Zapovednik and Zov Tigra Park (UALZZT) administration and staff; (2) Develop, train and equip two Rapid Response Teams (RRT), working with UALZZT; and, (3) Improve long-term monitoring of tiger populations in ULAZZT, by maintaining and upgrading the camera grid and camera trap data analysis tool.</narrative>
  </description>
